# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
Projects-card announcement -> Outlook drafts.  Light theme only.  Nothing is ever sent.

  python make_projects_drafts.py        creates 4 TEST drafts, each built a different way:
        [تجربة 1] tables only: real text, brand lines drawn with table cells
        [تجربة 2] header + footer as pictures, the letter as real text
        [تجربة 3] minimal letter: no dark blocks, fewest parts
        [تجربة 4] the whole design as one picture
     Send each one to yourself, open it on PC and phone, pick the cleanest.

  python make_projects_drafts.py 2      creates ONE clean draft of version 2 with the real
                                         subject (no [تجربة] tag), ready for recipients.

Needs Windows + Outlook desktop, and once:  pip install pywin32
Drafts are saved quietly (no windows pop up). Pictures go in as hidden inline images,
so they never show as attachments. Temporary picture files are deleted afterwards.
"""
